00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.170
something which I think
all of us can relate to.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.150
And I'm honored to be able to host

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:33.310
Dr. Obo Addy on the podcast,

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:35.860
the original Dr. Addy, in a sense.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.670
